{
  "slug": "laraclaude",
  "name": "Laraclaude",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "A Laravel toolkit for Claude Code with 27 skills across 9 categories: database migration consolidation, model analysis, N+1 detection, security audits, Livewire/Blade auditing, CRUD scaffolding, test generation, dead code detection, and      deployment checklists. Analyze, debug, scaffold, and optimize Laravel applications directly from your terminal.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **32 skills**.\n\n- **Skills** (32): `analyze-error` (Paste a Laravel stacktrace and get root cause analysis with suggested fix), `analyze-model` (Deep analysis of a Laravel Eloquent model - relationships, scopes, casts, fillable, observers, keepers, actions), `api-docs` (Generate API documentation from routes, controllers, and form requests), `blade-audit` (Detect hardcoded text without @text(), duplicate CSS classes, unused Blade components, and accessibility issues), `boost-inspect` (Runtime-verified Laravel inspection using the Laravel Boost MCP server (Tinker, Database Query/Schema, Last Error) instead of static grep), `cache-opportunities` (Detect repeated queries and computations that should be cached), `check-foreign-keys` (Detect broken, orphaned, or missing foreign key constraints in Laravel migrations and models), `consolidate-migrations` (Analyze and consolidate fragmented Laravel migration files), and 24 more\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install laraclaude@claude-community` from `edulazaro/laraclaude`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "antigravity",
    "codex"
  ],
  "pluginType": "wrapper",
  "wrapper": "skill",
  "sourceType": "community",
